## Architecture Pattern

**Pattern**: [layered | vertical-slice | clean]

**Selection Rationale**: [Why this pattern was chosen for this project]

### Pattern Reference

| Pattern | Best For | Structure |
|---------|----------|-----------|
| **Layered** (default) | Simple apps, CRUD, familiar teams | `src/controllers/`, `services/`, `models/` |
| **Vertical Slice** | Feature-focused, AI-assisted, rapid iteration | `features/auth/`, `features/orders/`, `shared/` |
| **Clean/Hexagonal** | Complex domains, long-term maintenance | `domain/`, `application/`, `infrastructure/` |

**Structure**:
```
[Document your actual folder structure here based on chosen pattern]

Example structures - pick ONE based on pattern:

Layered:
src/
├── controllers/
├── services/
├── models/
└── utils/

Vertical Slice:
features/
├── feature-a/
│   ├── components/
│   ├── api.ts
│   └── tests/
└── shared/

Clean:
src/
├── domain/
├── application/
├── infrastructure/
└── presentation/
```

**Notes**:
- IaC goes in `terraform/` or similar (NOT `infrastructure/` folder)
- Document infrastructure architecture in this file

